// Crops (farming spec 2.4). base_yield_measures is per acre of average soil (fertility 70), 1 measure = 1,100 g; seed_pct is of the base yield.
// fertility_delta is applied once per harvest. sow_doy and ripe_doy are days of the 60-day year. Winter grain is sown in autumn of the
// year before it ripens (sow_doy 36-45 of the previous year, ripe_doy 26).
